    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya v'asese",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I'zi hu' milagi' i'zyo u'ku'v'apa V'aizilaeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' wamugu'la musese wa ki'gosya wa Ki'ebulania, alaku'tu'mami'le ku' itungo lya myaka mukaga. Ali'vi mwaka gwa mupungati', u'lamuleku'li'le iyagalu'le na ku'wu'ka bila ndi'pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' ndi' wiza akatoola, alawu'ke inene. U'lu' ndi' wiza atoolile alawu'ke na muki' wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' mbe gu'ku' wakwe ndi' wamutozya muki'ma, nawe wamuv'yali'la v'ana v'a ki'gosya ninga v'a ki'ki'ma, hohene muki'ma mwenu'yo haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'alav'e nsawo yamwa gu'ku' wakwe, na mwenu'yo musese alawu'ke inene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi musese mwenu'yo u'lu' ayombe katwipandu' ha mbele yamwa gu'ku' wakwe ati', ‘Mbatogilwe gu'ku' wanne, muki' wanne haki'mo na v'ana v'anne, nkaanile ku'leku'li'lwa niyagalu'le na ku'hafuma,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hohene gu'ku' wakwe alamulete ha mbele yamwa Mulungu. Hangi' alamufile ha muzigo na alamutu'li'ki'zye itwi lyakwe ha mwi'i'mo ninga ha muzigo na ku'li'du'la na saziya. Haho alamutu'mami'le gu'ku' wakwe nsiku' zyose zya wikalo wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mbe muntu' wamugu'zya mwaniki' wakwe ku'v'a musese, mwenu'yo akasye aleku'li'lwe iyagalu'le ki'ti' v'asese v'a ki'gosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' gu'ku' ndi' wamukwa mwenu'yo av'e isuli'la wakwe, ali'vi akamutogezizye, haho alazumye akomolwe na ise. Gu'ku' mwenu'yo ali' wu'du'hu' lole ya ku'mugu'zya ku' v'antu' v'ageni v'a nsi' yi'ngi', ku'nguno wamuv'ezezizye wu'yengani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' wakoov'a ku'mutozya ku' mwana wakwe, yi'lamudime amuv'ezezye musese mwenu'yo lole ya ki'ti' mwaniki' mwana wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbe mwenu'yo gu'ku' asole muki'ma yu'ngi' av'e muki' wakwe ninga isuli'la wakwe akasye amudohezye isuli'la wakwe wa mbele viliwa, myenda na lole ya wu'kwele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa u'lu' waleka ku'mugelani'zi'zya lole zyeni'zi idatu', hohene isuli'la wakwe mwenu'yo alawu'ke na ku'leku'li'lwa aye bila ninga ku'fumya ndi'pi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya wu'kandi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
